### Research trail (why this is excluded)

1. Four independent public web searches on 2026-10-21 (including exact-phrase queries `"gpt-oss-120b-lite"` and `"gpt-oss-120b-lite" OR "gpt oss 120b lite"`) returned **no result for a lite ID** — every hit resolved to the standard `gpt-oss-120b` (OpenAI, 2025-08-05, 117B/5.1B-active MoE, Apache 2.0, 128K).
2. No BenchLM, llm-stats, Vals AI, serenitiesai, OpenRouter, Ollama, Hugging Face or NVIDIA catalog entry for a `gpt-oss-120b-lite` identifier was located.
3. **Standard `gpt-oss-120b` numbers were deliberately NOT imported** (GPQA Diamond 80.1, AIME25 92.5, SWE-V 62.4, HLE 14.9, etc.): the lite ID's relationship to the flagship model is unestablished — same standard applied elsewhere in this queue for unattributed IDs (no score borrowing without vendor confirmation).

